<div class=card><p>Across <b>53</b> (solver, judge) cells with both a static-grid gain and a realized k=5 rejection run: <b>Pearson r = +0.74</b>. Predicted judge gain tracks realized rejection-sampling improvement.</p></div></div>
<h2>4 · Gain / F1 / FNR matrices <span class=note>(rows = JUDGE model, cols = SOLVER model; diagonal = self; last column = each judge's average across solvers)</span></h2>